OL,3,A'Postcode lottery' driving children's
OL,4,Ainequality in England, commissioner
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer report, called the Childhood
OL,8,FLottery, found that deprivation alone
OL,9,Fcould not explain the differences in
OL,10,Ftheir experiences.
OL,12,FSome poorer areas had scored highly in
OL,13,Fher analysis compared to relatively
OL,14,Fwell-off ones.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
