OL,3,ABurnham says youth employment and
OL,4,Atraining crisis is a 'moral failure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has warned
OL,7,Fthe UK faces an "economic catastrophe
OL,8,Fand moral failure" due to the nearly
OL,9,Fone million young people not in
OL,10,Feducation, employment or training.
OL,12,FWriting in the Times newspaper, Burnham
OL,13,Fhas laid out his case for the
OL,14,Fgovernment to "invest in the success of
OL,15,Four young people" rather than "pay for
OL,16,Ffailure through the benefits system".
OL,18,F"Benefits will become the backstop, not
OL,19,Fthe starting point," Burnham wrote in
OL,20,Fhis piece published in Monday's paper.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
