OL,3,AFrance's government under pressure
OL,4,Aafter weekend of widespread violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere had been rumours in France that
OL,7,FPresident Emmanuel Macron may introduce
OL,8,Fa temporary curfew in parts of the
OL,9,Fcountry, or even impose a state of
OL,10,Femergency to help calm the febrile
OL,11,Fatmosphere. In the end, he used a
OL,12,Ftelevised address to the nation on
OL,13,FSunday to call for national unity and
OL,14,Fto try to assure the French public that
OL,15,Fthe perpetrators of the violence would
OL,16,Fbe punished.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
