OL,3,AMajor fire at Canada military base
OL,4,Aleaves four dead, dozens injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour members of the Canadian military
OL,7,Fhave died and dozens were injured in a
OL,8,Fmajor fire at a base in the province of
OL,9,FAlberta.
OL,11,FAddressing the nation on Sunday from
OL,12,FOttawa, Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,13,Fdescribed it as "one of the worst
OL,14,Ftragedies for the forces on Canadian
OL,15,Fsoil in peacetime".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
